oleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3989559874,"text":"もうすでに準備中？","nextNodeIds":[401960106]},{"nodeId":401960106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":950768946,"text":"ああ。昨日、アルジャントーさんから取引の時間と場所を聞いた。","nextNodeIds":[401960107]},{"nodeId":401960107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":1084846578,"text":"みんな知ってる場所だ。「本日午後、映影ランドのレストランで会おう」ってさ。","nextNodeIds":[401960108]},{"nodeId":401960108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3156341882,"text":"また映影ランドかよ！よっぽどお気に入りの場所なんだな。","nextNodeIds":[401960109]},{"nodeId":401960109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4109234754,"text":"あそこだと…","nextNodeIds":[401960110]},{"nodeId":401960110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2021823394,"text":"どうやら、旅人も同じことを心配してるようだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960111]},{"nodeId":401960111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1076,"speakerName":"ヌヴィレット","textMapHash":855081210,"text":"ああ。人の出入りが多いと、身柄の確保が難しくなる。","nextNodeIds":[401960112]},{"nodeId":401960112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1076,"speakerName":"ヌヴィレット","textMapHash":618774946,"text":"犯人が人混みに紛れ込み、人質をとって逃走する可能性もあるからだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960113]},{"nodeId":401960113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1076,"speakerName":"ヌヴィレット","textMapHash":1475908042,"text":"諸々に備えて、情報が入った昨日のうちに、マレショーセ・ファントムと特巡隊の手配は済ませてある。","nextNodeIds":[401960114]},{"nodeId":401960114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":3461684778,"text":"ああ。現場には私服警官を大量配置する予定だ。状況次第では、市民の安全確保を最優先する。","nextNodeIds":[401960115]},{"nodeId":401960115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":1279874618,"text":"もちろん、何事もなければそれが一番だが。","nextNodeIds":[401960116]},{"nodeId":401960116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3355173282,"text":"事件のことで世話になった特巡隊隊長のシュヴルーズさんたちも入るらしい——だから、俺は前向きに考えてる。","nextNodeIds":[401960117]},{"nodeId":401960117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":1001165714,"text":"信じてくれてありがとう、ナタの大英雄さん。","nextNodeIds":[401960118]},{"nodeId":401960118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":3598911642,"text":"それと、レピーヌ・ポーリーンさんやナヴィアさんとも、話を付けてきた。","nextNodeIds":[401960119]},{"nodeId":401960119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1076,"speakerName":"ヌヴィレット","textMapHash":858665090,"text":"棘薔薇の会が可能な範囲でサポートしてくれるから、心配はいらない。","nextNodeIds":[401960120]},{"nodeId":401960120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":4034335858,"text":"唯一の問題は…エスコフィエさんのほうかもしれないが…","nextNodeIds":[401960121,401960123]},{"nodeId":401960121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1649452730,"text":"犯罪者に料理を振る舞いたくない、とか？","nextNodeIds":[401960122]},{"nodeId":401960123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1359636514,"text":"犯罪者を料理してやろうと思ってるとか？","nextNodeIds":[401960124]},{"nodeId":401960122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":2762732826,"text":"ははっ、そうだったらやりやすいけどな。","nextNodeIds":[401960125]},{"nodeId":401960124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":1134561226,"text":"面白い発想だな。","nextNodeIds":[401960125]},{"nodeId":401960125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1076,"speakerName":"ヌヴィレット","textMapHash":3070728146,"text":"コホン…","nextNodeIds":[401960126]},{"nodeId":401960126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":3438767074,"text":"冗談だ。エスコフィエさんは、今回の作戦で自分の店が被害に遭うのはごめんなんだとさ。","nextNodeIds":[401960127]},{"nodeId":401960127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":1688459290,"text":"ははっ…そうはいかないって予感がするだろ。","nextNodeIds":[401960128]},{"nodeId":401960128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3200495066,"text":"何か手伝えることはある？","nextNodeIds":[401960129]},{"nodeId":401960129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":2321543042,"text":"いや、この件はあんたとは無関係なのに、すでにかなり迷惑をかけちまった。後のことはフォンテーヌの役人に任せてくれ。","nextNodeIds":[401960130]},{"nodeId":401960130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":34847962,"text":"と言いたいところだが、この事件の結末が気になるんだろう？","nextNodeIds":[401960131]},{"nodeId":401960131,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":565563586,"text":"うん。","nextNodeIds":[401960132]},{"nodeId":401960132,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":773781954,"text":"それじゃ、臨機応変に対応してくれ。必ずしも手を出す必要はない——ただ、万が一があったらな。","nextNodeIds":[401960133]},{"nodeId":401960133,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1030669466,"text":"そうならないように最善を尽くす。","nextNodeIds":[401960134]},{"nodeId":401960134,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2113773682,"text":"キィニチも作戦に参加するの？","nextNodeIds":[401960135]},{"nodeId":401960135,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1419069250,"text":"もちろんだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960136]},{"nodeId":401960136,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":4253247698,"text":"疑問は山積みだが、今ある情報を見る限り、犯人はナタ出身だ。","nextNodeIds":[401960137]},{"nodeId":401960137,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":266349474,"text":"俺も証人の一人だから、放っておく訳にはいかない。","nextNodeIds":[401960138]},{"nodeId":401960138,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3915615170,"text":"キィニチらしいな！","nextNodeIds":[401960139]},{"nodeId":401960139,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":1368118778,"text":"みんなで作戦の詳細や注意事項について、改めて話し合った。","nextNodeIds":[401960140]},{"nodeId":401960142,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":446194170,"text":"さて、こんなもんか。","nextNodeIds":[401960143]},{"nodeId":401960143,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1078,"speakerName":"リオセスリ","textMapHash":1902869906,"text":"作戦開始は午後だ。うまくいけば、出発前にまだお茶を何杯か飲めるな。","nextNodeIds":[401960144]},{"nodeId":401960144,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1004290,"text":"そうだな…オイラたちもなにか食べに行かないか？お腹いっぱいにならないと、力が出ないだろ！","nextNodeIds":[401960145]},{"nodeId":401960145,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":973894322,"text":"パイモンは見てるだけでしょ？","nextNodeIds":[401960146]},{"nodeId":401960146,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1746674698,"text":"寄り添うのも大事な仕事なんだぞ！","nextNodeIds":[401960147]},{"nodeId":401960147,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":4023386194,"text":"俺は先に会場に向かう。","nextNodeIds":[401960148]},{"nodeId":401960148,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":483173730,"text":"アハウがここ数日、イベント限定セットが食べたいとずっと騒いでるんだ。早く気のすむようにさせてやらないと。","nextNodeIds":[401960149]},{"nodeId":401960149,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2608964274,"text":"じゃあ、またあとで。","nextNodeIds":[401960150]},{"nodeId":401960150,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1076,"speakerName":"ヌヴィレット","textMapHash":3025596746,"text":"——いい知らせを待っている。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4019601,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDAN