eType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3420484930,"text":"そうか。","nextNodeIds":[401960209]},{"nodeId":401960209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2791788618,"text":"「観客」の目の前から連れ出したのは、お前のメンツを保つためだったんだが。","nextNodeIds":[401960210]},{"nodeId":401960210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2961577802,"text":"それに、頭から落ちるのも逆から落ちるのも、お前自身が決めたことだろ？","nextNodeIds":[401960211]},{"nodeId":401960211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":986662970,"text":"君…！","nextNodeIds":[401960212]},{"nodeId":401960212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":3721489810,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[401960213]},{"nodeId":401960213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":3846313210,"text":"わ、分かりました。私が悪かったと認めましょう。","nextNodeIds":[401960214]},{"nodeId":401960214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":2321967298,"text":"はぁ…善悪の区別くらい、ついてます。でも、本当にモラが必要で、どうしようもなく…","nextNodeIds":[401960215]},{"nodeId":401960215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":2185695554,"text":"私は元々古代遺跡研究の専門家で、幸せな家庭と仕事に恵まれて順風満帆でした。","nextNodeIds":[401960216]},{"nodeId":401960216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":3447787498,"text":"それなのに、まさか息子がギャンブルにハマってしまうなんて…貯金はあっという間に底をつきました…","nextNodeIds":[401960217]},{"nodeId":401960217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":2904825042,"text":"借金ができてからは、息子が債権者から脅迫されるようになって…父親として、息子がひどい目に遭うのを黙って見るわけにはいかないでしょう？","nextNodeIds":[401960218]},{"nodeId":401960218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":4271316906,"text":"はぁ、息子は君と同じ年頃なんですが…君のようにまともに育ってくれればよかったのに…とにかく、そういうわけでモラが必要だったんです…！","nextNodeIds":[401960219]},{"nodeId":401960219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3298521874,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[401960220]},{"nodeId":401960220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":2522595258,"text":"あの…","nextNodeIds":[401960221]},{"nodeId":401960221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":378225450,"text":"お願いです！どうか助けてください！","nextNodeIds":[401960222]},{"nodeId":401960222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":3500848082,"text":"ナタ人同士のよしみで、見逃してくださいませんか…！","nextNodeIds":[401960223]},{"nodeId":401960223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":1728863346,"text":"帰して頂ければ、ドラ息子をしっかり教育します。しかし…私が捕まれば、息子は死んでしまうかもしれません！","nextNodeIds":[401960224]},{"nodeId":401960224,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":2931873522,"text":"家族とは、より良い未来のために一緒に頑張るものでしょう？","nextNodeIds":[401960225]},{"nodeId":401960225,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":4245510258,"text":"一家の運命は君の手にかかってます。どうか、お願いします！","nextNodeIds":[401960226]},{"nodeId":401960226,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3490905658,"text":"……","nextNodeIds":[401960227]},{"nodeId":401960227,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":2675097258,"text":"ハハッ、おいキィニチ、なんで黙ってるんだ？まさか、ほだされたのか？","nextNodeIds":[401960228]},{"nodeId":401960228,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1411652930,"text":"フン。","nextNodeIds":[401960229]},{"nodeId":401960229,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2533919554,"text":"お前の言葉なんて一ミリも信用できない。","nextNodeIds":[401960230]},{"nodeId":401960230,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1262870826,"text":"リオセスリさんの予想通りだ。お前は根っからのギャンブラーだな。","nextNodeIds":[401960231]},{"nodeId":401960231,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":1158268714,"text":"えっ、私がギャンブラーですって？違います。それは息子の話で…","nextNodeIds":[401960232]},{"nodeId":401960232,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3199004298,"text":"大体、お前は本当にナタ人なのか？","nextNodeIds":[401960233]},{"nodeId":401960233,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":473452642,"text":"ナタ人なら、銃の行方を監視していた間に、見覚えのある顔に気づいたはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960234]},{"nodeId":401960234,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1078561994,"text":"対して——「法廷」のくだりはすらすら出たな。","nextNodeIds":[401960235]},{"nodeId":401960235,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":3547228586,"text":"そ、それくらいのことで…","nextNodeIds":[401960236]},{"nodeId":401960236,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":15252,"speakerName":"アングルヴァン","textMapHash":943029994,"text":"せ、説明しましょう！実は小さい頃から…","nextNodeIds":[401960237]},{"nodeId":401960237,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3498382274,"text":"ちっ…これ以上聞きたくない。","nextNodeIds":[401960238]},{"nodeId":401960238,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":901505530,"text":"アハウ、口を塞ぐチャンスをやる。どうだ？","nextNodeIds":[401960239]},{"nodeId":401960239,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":4293356170,"text":"ハハハッ、その言葉、待ってたぜ！","nextNodeIds":[401960240]},{"nodeId":401960240,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":553713874,"text":"この恥知らずめ、喰らえ！","nextNodeIds":[401960241]},{"nodeId":401960241,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":863601306,"text":"嘘ばかりつくのがギャンブラーの特徴だ。","nextNodeIds":[401960242]},{"nodeId":401960242,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2348998874,"text":"お前はナタ人に成りすましたフォンテーヌ人だろう？家族や友達なんていないと俺は推測してる。いたとしても、とっくに離れていったはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960243]},{"nodeId":401960243,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":629438122,"text":"もちろん、外れてる可能性もある。","nextNodeIds":[401960244]},{"nodeId":401960244,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1662807106,"text":"——だが、だからなんだ？","nextNodeIds":[401960245]},{"nodeId":401960245,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1053416394,"text":"俺は身柄の確保を任されただけで、お前の代理人じゃなければ、お悩み相談の相手でもない。","nextNodeIds":[401960246]},{"nodeId":401960246,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1378057954,"text":"お前の口から真相を聞き出すのは、お前が大好きな法廷の役目だ。違うか？","nextNodeIds":[401960247]},{"nodeId":401960247,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":3256171722,"text":"ああ。","nextNodeIds":[401960248]},{"nodeId":401960248,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":2152732306,"text":"キィニチさん、久しぶりだな。容疑者は引き取ろう。","nextNodeIds":[401960249]},{"nodeId":401960249,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1159246898,"text":"ああ、頼む。","nextNodeIds":[401960250]},{"nodeId":401960250,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":3854677874,"text":"ご協力、改めて感謝する。","nextNodeIds":[401960251]},{"nodeId":401960251,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":881328618,"text":"オレにはないのか？失礼だな！この偉大なる聖龍に礼も言えないのかよ！？","nextNodeIds":[401960252]},{"nodeId":401960252,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1081,"speakerName":"シュヴルーズ","textMapHash":3811823330,"text":"ああ——カクークくんとの素晴らしいショーをありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[401960253]},{"nodeId":401960253,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":4176790946,"text":"えっ——何だそれは！おい、待て——","nextNodeIds":[401960254]},{"nodeId":401960254,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":689735802,"text":"キィニチ、大丈夫？","nextNodeIds":[401960255]},{"nodeId":401960255,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3235527522,"text":"引きずって行かれたのは俺じゃない。","nextNodeIds":[401960256]},{"nodeId":401960256,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2771383210,"text":"さっき、暗い顔をしてなかった？","nextNodeIds":[401960257]},{"nodeId":401960257,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":4207857594,"text":"ププッ、ちびちびニチだった頃のことを思い出したんだろ？","nextNodeIds":[401960258]},{"nodeId":401960258,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":1410357874,"text":"泣きべそかくなよ！泣き虫な下僕なんて、恥ずかしいからな！","nextNodeIds":[401960259]},{"nodeId":401960259,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2637093130,"text":"何を言ってる…","nextNodeIds":[401960260]},{"nodeId":401960260,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":29852458,"text":"アハウって意地悪。","nextNodeIds":[401960261]},{"nodeId":401960261,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3203361098,"text":"…別に隠すことはない。簡単に言えば、ギャンブラーが嫌いなんだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960262]},{"nodeId":401960262,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2026726226,"text":"この世で最も無責任で、努力とその結果を尊重しないやつらだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960263]},{"nodeId":401960263,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1815347186,"text":"コイン一枚のために、幾千万もの嘘を平気でつき、手の中にあるコインで幾千万もの富を生み出すことを夢見てる。","nextNodeIds":[401960264]},{"nodeId":401960264,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1370860122,"text":"だが、タダで手に入れたものの裏には、想像を絶する代償が隠されてるんだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960265]},{"nodeId":401960265,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":905006098,"text":"昔の暮らしは、父が賭けに負けた代償の一部だった。できれば、誰にも同じ目に遭ってほしくない。","nextNodeIds":[401960266]},{"nodeId":401960266,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2374545498,"text":"キィニチ…","nextNodeIds":[401960267]},{"nodeId":401960267,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1460658282,"text":"同情する必要はない。悲しいとは思ってないから。","nextNodeIds":[401960268]},{"nodeId":401960268,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":152824466,"text":"人間は過去でできてるって、人は言う。なら、ここまで歩んでこれたのは、きっと正しいことをたくさんしてきたからだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960269]},{"nodeId":401960269,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3061804546,"text":"他人の過ちのために、苦しむ必要なんかない。","nextNodeIds":[401960270]},{"nodeId":401960270,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2610208010,"text":"そんなことより、俺は成長した瞬間を覚えておくようにしてる。","nextNodeIds":[401960271]},{"nodeId":401960271,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":351695410,"text":"例えば、初めてカギ縄の使い方を覚えた瞬間とか——","nextNodeIds":[401960272]},{"nodeId":401960272,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":1713366154,"text":"初めて知識を求めた時とかな。","nextNodeIds":[401960273]},{"nodeId":401960273,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2021052570,"text":"そっか。","nextNodeIds":[401960274]},{"nodeId":401960274,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":32775650,"text":"ああ。","nextNodeIds":[401960275]},{"nodeId":401960275,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3778759330,"text":"それじゃ、行こう。そろそろ戻らないと、みんなが心配する。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[4019602,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","