LE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2735560490,"text":"ま、パレ・メルモニアの仕事だし、オイラたちにはあんまり関係ないけどな。","nextNodeIds":[401960309]},{"nodeId":401960309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1070,"speakerName":"シャルロット","textMapHash":2240015018,"text":"質問攻めに遭わないうちに逃げたとしか思えないけど。","nextNodeIds":[401960310]},{"nodeId":401960310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1070,"speakerName":"シャルロット","textMapHash":909132658,"text":"はぁ…ま、いつものことね。","nextNodeIds":[401960311]},{"nodeId":401960311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2008435178,"text":"えっ、取材のチャンスをあっさり諦めちゃうのか！","nextNodeIds":[401960312]},{"nodeId":401960312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1070,"speakerName":"シャルロット","textMapHash":1407822122,"text":"へへ、実はいい写真がたっぷり撮れたの。これなら一面を派手に飾る記事が書けるわ！","nextNodeIds":[401960313]},{"nodeId":401960313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1070,"speakerName":"シャルロット","textMapHash":3337364538,"text":"ということで——さっそく写真を現像して記事作成に取り掛かりたいから、お先に失礼するわね！","nextNodeIds":[401960314]},{"nodeId":401960314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":609470914,"text":"オイラがかっこよく写ってるやつにしてくれよ！","nextNodeIds":[401960315]},{"nodeId":401960315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1534151354,"text":"あっ、行っちゃった。聞こえてたかな。","nextNodeIds":[401960316]},{"nodeId":401960316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3539489106,"text":"プロのカメラマンの腕を信じよう。","nextNodeIds":[401960317]},{"nodeId":401960317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2811335858,"text":"へへっ、それもそうだな！","nextNodeIds":[401960318]},{"nodeId":401960318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":946825122,"text":"それより、ずいぶん遅かったけど、なにかあったのか？","nextNodeIds":[401960319,401960324]},{"nodeId":401960319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3826642394,"text":"アハウが頭をぶつけてめそめそしてた。","nextNodeIds":[401960320]},{"nodeId":401960320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":1719553242,"text":"なんだって！？","nextNodeIds":[401960321]},{"nodeId":401960321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":4064285858,"text":"てめぇ、何デタラメ言ってやがる！","nextNodeIds":[401960322]},{"nodeId":401960322,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":2074125322,"text":"この「偉大なる聖龍」クフル・アハウが、そんな醜態を晒したことがあるか？","nextNodeIds":[401960323]},{"nodeId":401960323,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3135307650,"text":"醜態はいつものことだろ。","nextNodeIds":[401960329]},{"nodeId":401960329,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3331092978,"text":"これからどうするの？","nextNodeIds":[401960330]},{"nodeId":401960330,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3629369018,"text":"そうだな…実はまだ決まってないんだ。","nextNodeIds":[401960331]},{"nodeId":401960331,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":121274938,"text":"急ぎの用事もないし、法廷からまた証人として呼ばれるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[401960332]},{"nodeId":401960332,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":3071932514,"text":"あの銃も重要な物証だから、事件の審理が終わるまではナタに持ち帰れないだろうし…","nextNodeIds":[401960333]},{"nodeId":401960333,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2868116210,"text":"今はもうしばらく、砂浜と海を楽しむことにする。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":401960324,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4016473418,"text":"キィニチが頭をぶつけてめそめそしてた。","nextNodeIds":[401960325]},{"nodeId":401960325,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1088,"speakerName":"キィニチ","textMapHash":2042789146,"text":"そう言うことにしておこう。","nextNodeIds":[401960326]},{"nodeId":401960326,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":14221,"speakerName":"アハウ","textMapHash":1977823754,"text":"ギャハハッ、ちびニチ、誰もよしよし